{"title":"Rhinoceros Beetle","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 27 Beetle that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sunken Trove</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-2007\">Layout</button></li><li><b>West Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 3</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-11\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Beetle: <a href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle\">Stag Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(21)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bombardier-beetle\">Bombardier Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/eae665e0c3e9d7ce9b37.webp\" alt=\"Rhinoceros Beetle\"></div><h3>Rhinoceros Beetle</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>27 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–27)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Beetle</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1350</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>9 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}